---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Change the note on a highlight you made, by its id (shown by `reading open` and in `reading export --format json`). A blank TEXT clears the note. Preview with --dry-run; `mxr undo` restores the old note. Highlights made in Marginalia are changed there

Usage: mxr reading note [OPTIONS] <HIGHLIGHT> <TEXT>

Arguments:
  <HIGHLIGHT>
  <TEXT>

Options:
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
